    title: "Making animations",
    lead: `When a gimmick changes how something looks, you write what changes, and how, in an animation clip. This tip explains what's inside a clip, what you can move from FX, how to make clips by recording in Unity, how to place keyframes, and how to fix a broken path that shows "Missing!".`,
    meta: "This covers Unity's Built-in Render Pipeline and VRChat avatars (Avatars 3.0). Information as of November 2026.",
