      "Press the red circle (the record button) at the top left. The timeline turns red, and recording starts.",
      "Make sure the white vertical line (the current time) is at frame 0. You can also move it by typing <code>0</code> in the time field.",
      "Select the hat (Hat) in the Hierarchy, and check the box at the top left of the Inspector to turn it on. A <code>Hat : Is Active</code> row appears in the Animation window, with a key at frame 0.",
      "Type <code>1</code> in the time field to move to frame 1. Select the <code>Hat : Is Active</code> row in the Animation window and press the <code>Add Keyframe</code> button (a diamond with a +). A key with the same value (on) is added at frame 1 too.",
      "Press the red circle again to stop recording.",
