      "Make sure the hat in the Hierarchy is back to how it was before recording (off). If it isn't, set it back with the checkbox in the Inspector.",
      "Set the <code>Controller</code> of the Animator component on your avatar's top object back to how it was (usually None). VRChat doesn't use this field. It uses the controllers in the Playable Layers slots. If you leave yours here, it's harder to tell which controller is the real one.",
