      "<strong>Everything you touch while recording goes into the clip.</strong> Don't move other objects or try out values while recording. To delete a row that got in, right-click it in the Animation window and choose <code>Remove Properties</code>.",
      `When you connect with Modular Avatar's MA Merge Animator, you can also add an Animator component to the gimmick object and record there. The "Paths" section below explains this. ${tipLink("toggle", "connect")} shows how to connect it to your avatar.`,
